  - m_Id: 43881077108891698
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Take care of yourself, alright?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43881077108891697
    m_Localized: 'Luka: And from there, things can get real dark, real fast.'
