    m_Localized: 'Couple: My wife isn’t very fond of kids, you see. Didn’t expect to find someone that young here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43881077108891677
    m_Localized: 'Couple: Look, I don’t mean to be difficult, but we just… we can’t stay here with {0} around.'
